 "description": "Thrust, torque and shaft power for one propeller, from its printed size.\n\n    A closed-form momentum plus blade-element equation \u2014 no motor, no battery,\n    no account. Give the size as it is printed: a 10x5 is `diameter_in=10`,\n    `pitch_in=5`. `chord_ratio` is the chord at 75 % radius over the diameter:\n    0.065 thin electric, 0.07 sport, 0.10 slow flyer, 0.11 multirotor.\n    ",
